WEBVTT

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
ashita he tsuzuku sakamichi no tochuu de

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
On the uphill road that leads to tomorrow

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
surechigau otona tachi wa tsubuyaku no sa

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
We pass by adults who tell us this

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"ai toka yume toka risou mo wakaru kedo

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"I can understand ideals such as love and dreams

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
me no mae no genjitsu wa sonna ni amaku nai" tte

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
but the real world isn't as easy as you think"

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
tsumazuki nagara mo korogari nagara mo

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
Even though we keep tripping and falling

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
kasabuta darake no jyounetsu wo wasuretaku nai

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
We have to remember these pains of growing up

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
otona ni narenai bokura no

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
For all of us who can't force ourselves to do so yet

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
tsuyogari wo hitotsu kiite kure

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
Listen to this one thing I have to say

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
nige mo kakure mo shinai kara

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
I won't run or cower away

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
waraitai yatsu dake warae

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
So whoever wants to laugh at me, go ahead

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
semete tayori nai bokura no

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
Since we can't be relied upon yet

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
jiyuu no me wo tsumitoranai de

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
Don't take away our seed of freedom

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
mizu wo ageru sono yakume wo

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
The task of nurturing this plant

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
hataseba iindarou?

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
That's all we have to do, right?

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:30.020
{Intro}

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:36.780
There is no way I can
understand this red book.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:40.660
I've been trying to read this book all night,
and I haven't gotten anywhere.

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:43.830
The only part I can read is the
part that's a different color.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.790
"The first spell, 'Zakeru'."

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:49.000
Take this! The first spell...

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:51.500
I beg you, please come out lightning...

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:53.130
Zakeru!

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:57.300
What?

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:10.610
This power is on a different scale
from the one this morning...

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:14.150
What's the matter, Kiyomaro?

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:16.900
Lightning sure strikes a lot around here.

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:18.410
What?

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:21.160
How could he be so carefree...

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.950
Even after releasing all that lightning,
he didn't even realize it was him.

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:31.630
But who would have thought I would have
gotten into a fight with that punk, Kaneyama.

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:35.000
Go, go!

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.970
Kiyomaro, you have a great
look on your face right now.

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:43.810
You look more alive than ever before.

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:45.850
Alive?

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.270
Look more alive than ever before, eh?

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:56.030
Owww!

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:57.490
Be quiet, Kiyomaro.

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:03.160
I was sleeping so well,
but thanks to you I'm wide awake now.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.290
He really is a pest...

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:06.330
{Part A}

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:14.790
Freezing Spell, Gikoru vs Zakeru

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.550
Wait, are you trying to run
away from me, Kamakiri-kyo?

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:18.550
What?

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:20.430
Jo-kick!

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:29.350
In any case, Gash isn't a normal kid,

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.020
he has horns,

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:34.190
and his injuries from the
fight have already healed.

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:37.820
I won't last long if I hang out with him.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:39.030
And besides,

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:44.370
who were those two with the
power to control wind?

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.620
A book exactly like the red one.

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:51.040
A kid with the same eyes as Gash's.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:56.090
The reason we got attacked
is probably because of this pest.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.470
Gash-chan, what are you doing?

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:06.180
I was thinking about taking this funny
box that shows pictures to school.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.180
But, it's too heavy.

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:10.560
It looks like it's too heavy for you.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.100
Well then, Kiyomaro!

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.520
Ally of Justice plan

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:16.060
Let's try our best with the "Ally
of Justice" plan today as well!

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.730
You're still trying to do that?

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:20.150
Of course.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:24.030
I was asked by your father
to handle your training,

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:28.540
so if this helps you make friends,
I will do it every day!

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:29.870
That's bothersome.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.290
Stop following me!

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.330
When you're with me, I feel embarrassed.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.920
I didn't know that you felt embarrassed
when you were around me.

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:39.500
Kiyomaro!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.210
Gash-chan is just a little kid!

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.170
How can you talk to him like that?

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:44.550
Poor guy...

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.300
You're not being frank, Kiyomaro!

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.310
If the sports bag look is embarrassing,
you should have told me earlier!

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:50.520
How about this?

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.560
That's not what I meant...

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.520
I have a lot of other ones prepared as well.

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:57.480
Ta-da!

00:04:58.150 --> 00:04:59.570
This kind as well.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.400
Every one of them suits you.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:08.030
Which one do you like the most?

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.290
The usual one, after all.

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:12.330
Yes, that's what I thought.

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.720
Such nice weather...

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.680
The nice cherry blossom trees...

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:31.600
The nice smell of fish from the river...

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:37.730
The fish are frozen!

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:46.740
What is this... It's spring and there's ice?

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:50.240
What an extraordinary occurrence...
Is this the end of the world?

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.460
That blue book...
looks exactly as this one.

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:02.210
I'm sorry, but I'm going to take this car.

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:08.680
And a kid that looks similar to Gash...

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:11.470
Is this the kid that created the ice?

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:13.470
Let's go, Reikomu.

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:14.520
All right, Hosokawa.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:23.730
Oh, my fortune for this week
is a sign that foretells great luck;

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:26.780
the rarest and best sign of luck.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:33.240
Oh yeah, yesterday Takamine-kun
came and rescued me.

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:39.040
Maybe I should buy him a
mango shake to thank him.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.710
I think that would be nice.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:43.750
Well, I better finish my
mom's bank transfers.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.220
But, Takamine-kun looks like
he can eat at least three burgers.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:50.390
I'm going to run out of
this week's allowance.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:52.800
Oh my, what am I thinking about?

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:55.180
Shut up!

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:57.930
Quit yapping, and put your hands up!

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:03.520
And I was supposed to have great luck...

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.440
What's with Kaneyama's bandage?

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.530
Look, Takamine is injured too.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:13.030
Maybe Kaneyama got into
a fight with Takamine?

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.530
I highly doubt that.

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:17.950
A smart guy, who can't
make a single friend,

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.000
can't have enough courage for that.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.120
That's true.

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:22.540
All alone...

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:24.840
Kiyomaro does have courage!

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:26.380
Who is this kid?

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:29.670
I am Kiyomaro's #1 friend, Gash Bell!

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:34.100
Yesterday, Kiyomaro fought with a
punk that had beaten Kaneyama,

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:36.600
and surprisingly, drove him away.

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:39.020
Stop messing around!

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:43.520
Why would trash like Takamine
be able to drive him away?

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:46.650
It's because Kiyomaro is an Ally of Justice.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.530
You might not have realized this
because you were unconscious,

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:51.320
but Suzume-dono saw it!

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:52.910
That's enough, Gash.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.370
Kiyomaro! Why won't you
say anything back?

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:58.410
It's because you make up such bullcrap!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.420
Kiyomaro...

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:07.250
Kiyomaro, why didn't
you say anything back?

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.800
Even though you fought
so bravely yesterday...

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:16.180
I told you, your face looked
more alive than ever before.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:20.600
Don't you care that he said those
kinds of things, Kiyomaro?

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:23.230
I'm so upset...

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:26.150
I lost that emotion a long time ago.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:28.730
Let them say whatever they want.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.450
Breaking news!

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:38.790
A man with a gun has fortified
himself in the Kabutomushi bank.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.950
Here's the view from a security camera.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:45.670
Oh Kiyomaro, this weird
box thing you call a TV,

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.460
has Suzume-dono on it.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:48.920
Mizuno is on TV?

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.800
What?

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:53.260
She got caught again?

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:58.760
That guy!

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:02.430
The guy holding the blue book.

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:04.810
Kiyomaro, we're going to go rescue her.

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:08.940
But, he has the power to control ice...

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.360
Trying to save her from that guy...

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.030
What's wrong, Kiyomaro?

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:16.610
Suzume-dono is your only ally in school.

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:17.700
But...

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:20.540
We just lost our feed
from the security camera.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:22.500
It looks like he shot it.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:25.500
Suzume-dono might get shot!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:28.460
That's right, if I have
Gash and the red book...

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:34.050
But I can't, the lightning is too strong.

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:36.590
If I make one mistake, it might get worse.

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:39.680
Kiyomaro, why are you stalling?

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:40.930
It's impossible!

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.930
It's not something we can deal with.

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:45.520
This is something you
should leave to the police.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:46.810
Are you running away?

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:51.690
You're not lying to yourself, are you?

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.030
Shut up!

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.530
Lying to myself, eh?

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:59.990
I'm the person who knows that the best...

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:04.160
Another shot has been fired! This time,
it was at the policemen approaching the bank!

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:07.920
Kiyomaro, are you sure
this is what you want?

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.590
Dammit, this is exactly how I used to be.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:14.090
Trying to make excuses,
saying I'm too weak...

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:16.300
But the real reason is, I'm scared...

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:19.260
Stop lying to yourself, Kiyomaro!

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:27.480
Gash... I would change, if I could.
But...

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:28.940
Run, Kiyomaro!

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:32.320
Don't think anymore!

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:34.650
Run now, think later!

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.620
That's the spirit, Kiyomaro.

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.330
Run Kiyomaro!

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:56.210
That's right, Gash isn't a pest or anything.

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:59.130
I'm going to change with him!

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:08.060
{Part B}

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:22.030
Wait for me, Mizuno.
I'll rescue you, no matter what!

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.700
I can see it Gash. That's the bank.

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:30.330
That's a lot of money.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:32.290
Reikomu, you're the best.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:35.130
With this book, there's nothing I can't get.

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:40.840
All right! Any sudden movement, and I'll shoot
you down, even if you're a woman or child!

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:43.800
Please, someone help us. Hurry!

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:47.810
Kiyomaro, there are a lot of people in blue
surrounding the place. Can you still get in?

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:50.890
It might get rough this way, but...

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:55.110
I'm going to throw Gash through the second
floor window to distract the guards.

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:57.070
Then I'll rush in.

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:59.030
The rest is up to luck!

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:00.780
Gash, pray to the heavens!

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:03.160
Oh, the "Praying to the
Heavens" plan, eh?

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:06.530
I'm hoping that you can fly!

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:08.080
Kattomen Gash!

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:10.580
What? You're planning to throw me?

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:12.210
Go!

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:15.580
- I won't let that happen!
- What?

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:19.510
An unexpected development...

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:25.300
What the...

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:27.760
Who's there?
Come out quietly!

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:29.890
Kiyomaro, it hurts...

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:32.390
Keep quiet, I'm hurt too...

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:36.560
Brago, that person...

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.650
He had a red book.

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:41.530
Are you with the cops?

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:43.280
Hurry up and come out!

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:46.200
Well, so far everything is all right.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:50.370
I didn't know what was going to happen,
but it looks like the robber hasn't seen us yet.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:53.330
And the kid doesn't seem too concerned.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:59.420
Then that means, while I distract the suspect,
Gash can sneak up behind him.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:04.930
Then from there, we can attack the
robber without endangering the hostages...

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.180
It's a perfect plan.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:11.850
Okay Gash, with my plan, we're going to...

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:13.180
What the... Gash?

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:14.390
What?

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:16.770
My name is Gash Bell!

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:19.980
I have come to defeat you villains!

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.320
Who the hell is this little brat?

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.570
My perfect plan...

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:27.370
Oh wait, they don't
know that I'm here yet.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:32.950
While Gash is distracting the robbers,
I might be able to do something...

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:38.580
You're the little kid that was
with Takamine-kun, Gash-kun!

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:41.340
Oh, Suzume-dono, you're safe!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:43.670
Where's Takamine-kun? Is he here?

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:46.720
Of course, he's hiding back there.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.760
Takamine-kun, Takamine-kun!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:49.760
Shut up!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.310
It was great luck after all...

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:53.970
Why did they tell them I was here...

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:55.560
Those guys are idiots.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.020
It's all over...

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:59.810
Wait a second, I can still do something!

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:02.230
Hey, other guy, come out!

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:06.200
If you're a cop, I will kill
everyone, including you!

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:08.660
Wait, I'm a junior high school student.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:09.740
Takamine-kun...

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:11.240
Don't shoot.

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:15.080
Besides, there's another
person hiding over there.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:18.670
What? There's another one hiding?

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.630
Come out!
If you don't, I will kill you!

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:27.130
All right, he's moving
away from the hostages,

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:30.340
and Gash is behind the suspect.

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:32.640
If Gash releases lightning right now...

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:36.020
We could beat the robber
without hurting anyone else.

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.310
What's wrong, Kiyomaro?

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:40.860
Gash, just stare at the robber.

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:43.320
Ah, an "Ally of Justice" plan?

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:45.320
Now I can do it...

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:46.990
That red book...

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.490
All right...
Zakeru!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.750
The lightning isn't coming out!
Why?

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:59.040
I said the same spell yesterday!

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.380
Dammit, once more!
Come out, lightning!

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:03.590
Zakeru!

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:07.420
Kiyomaro, how long should
I stare at the robber?

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:09.720
Why isn't it coming out?

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:14.640
Because you had that book, I was wondering
what kind of spell was going to come out...

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:18.180
What a disappointment;
you can't even use it yet.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:22.190
You looked like a very heroic boy,
but this is how it is, huh?

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:26.230
You thought you were going to get
power from that book, but...

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:29.240
It's a waste for you to have it.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:31.530
Just give me the book.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.240
If you refuse, you're going to get hurt!

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:36.370
But...

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:39.250
Don't ever let them have it, Kiyomaro!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.170
We are Allies of Justice!

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:44.420
You villains are the ones
who are going to get hurt!

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:46.340
This is your last chance to apologize!

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:47.340
Shut up!

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:50.090
This isn't good...
Run away, Gash!

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:51.470
Why?

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:54.350
I didn't do anything bad,
so why should I run?

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:56.060
Let's go, Reikomu.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:59.600
Take this,

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:00.810
Gikoru!

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:12.910
Kiyomaro...

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:15.240
It's cold and...

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:17.240
What is this?

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:19.450
Gash got frozen?

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:21.250
Gash, are you all right?

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.080
There's no point in talking to him.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:26.500
He can't hear any voices outside.
He's probably unconscious.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.670
Dammit!

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:28.920
It's useless.

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.220
You can't melt this ice with your strength.

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:35.180
I can't even use Zakeru's
lightning anymore...

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:38.640
If you leave him, even
his heart will freeze.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:42.770
If you don't want that, hand me the book.

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:45.770
That kid, just like Reikomu, will be mine!

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:47.060
But...

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:52.030
Don't ever let them have it, Kiyomaro!

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.450
We are Allies of Justice!

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.490
I've already decided...

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:00.910
I'm going to change with Gash.

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.910
I'm not going to give you this book!

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:06.630
I guess you won't understand
until I kill someone!

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:07.670
What?

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.050
Let me tell you, I'm not joking.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:13.550
Right now, I'm not afraid of killing people.

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.050
I'm not scared of the police either.

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:21.140
I'm strong. Thanks to this
book, I've gained power.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:22.730
I'm going to get killed...

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:24.810
Stop it, stop it, please!

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.560
I don't want Mizuno to die!

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:28.060
I want to help her!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:30.570
It's flashing...

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.650
What?

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:39.700
Gash!

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:44.040
These people are going to die!

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:47.250
I beg you... Save them, Gash!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:49.290
Save Mizuno!

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:56.930
Zakeru!

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:08.350
- What is that?
- We're going in!

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:10.360
We're saved...

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:13.110
- Stop the fire!
- It's smoking! Open the windows!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:14.820
Gash...

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:18.530
Oh, Kiyomaro!

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:21.740
You're amazing!
What did you do?

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:25.330
What did I do? You don't
remember anything, again?

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:31.670
I remember. When I was frozen,
I suddenly heard your voice.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:36.880
Does that mean, because of this book,
my thoughts travelled to Gash?

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:41.300
When I heard your voice asking for help,
the villains were blown away.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:44.100
It was a voice filled with emotions!

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:48.440
Emotions? This book reacts
to strong emotions?

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:52.060
The lightning doesn't come out
from simply reading the spell...

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:54.610
Lightning that only comes
out with strong emotions...

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:56.030
Takamine-kun!

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:58.700
I was really scared.

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:00.860
Thank you so much for saving me.

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:03.370
But, I didn't really do anything...

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.990
What are you talking about?

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:10.040
Because you planned ahead, and overcame
a disadvantage, you defeated the robbers.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.630
As expected from the #1
genius of our school.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:15.050
I see, Kiyomaro!

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:18.630
As your instructor, I feel proud as well!

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.890
Our first case has been settled!

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:25.510
In addition, our "Ally of Justice"
plan was a great success today!

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:30.060
But for some reason, I have a feeling
I'm forgetting something really important...

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:31.650
Forgetting something important?

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:34.310
- Where did the robber go?
- He's not here!

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:44.320
Thanks to a brave junior high student, the
robbery of the Kabutomushi bank was stopped.

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:46.790
However, the suspects are still on the run.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:49.370
- Dammit!
- We will get revenge on them!

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:53.500
Why are more and more demons
appearing in this city?

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.840
Because of Gash.

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:58.300
A demon's power attracts
other demons, as well as tragedies.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:01.590
That's the kind of battle
that is going to begin.

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:02.680
That's me!

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:04.850
You and I are on it, Kiyomaro!

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:06.260
Amazing, Kiyomaro!

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:07.810
I'm really proud of you.

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:10.100
You look so different
from the old Kiyomaro.

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:12.140
Have I changed a bit?

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:17.110
Of course. It's because I'm placing
my faith in you as your instructor!

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:19.400
Gash-chan, you're very bright today.

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:21.990
It seems like you've matured a bit too.

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:24.910
Oh, have I grown as well?

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:28.240
Maybe I can lift this box this time!

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.040
I did it!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.160
I can do it with one arm too!

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:34.170
Wow, that's amazing, Gash-chan!

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:36.590
Maybe I'll ask you to carry
a tsukemonoishi later.

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:37.920
Tsukemonoishi is a container
made of stone to preserve vegetables.

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:38.750
Wait a minute...

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:41.010
He's grown way too fast...

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.130
Well...

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:50.180
Does that mean that when I use
this book's powers, Gash grows?

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:51.600
This is...

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:54.600
The color of this page changed.

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:56.020
I can read it!

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:58.070
I can read this page now!

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:00.820
"The second spell, 'Rashirudo'."

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:04.660
Gash has another power now?

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:05.030
{Ending}

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.750
ne konna koto tsuzukete itemo

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.750
You know, even if we continue to progress like this

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:25.970
shiawase wa mitsukaru no kana?

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:25.970
Will we be able to find true happiness?

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:31.100
tarinai mono kazoete mitemo

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:31.100
When I try counting what is missing in my life

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:36.230
kiri ga nai no wakatteru you

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:36.230
I know the list will keep going on and on

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:41.900
shinario douri nante

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:41.900
Everything goes according to plans

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:46.660
umaku iku wake nai kara

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:46.660
Of course that can never happen

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.280
toki ni wa zenbu

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.280
At times, everything that I have

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.120
nagedashi taku naru

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.120
I just want to let it all go

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:57.920
sonna hi ga attemo iiyone

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:57.920
Is it uncommon to have days like this?

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:05.470
hito wa mina okubyou dakara

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:05.470
Everyone is afraid, even though we don't show it

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:10.010
yume wo miru no kana?

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:10.010
Is that why we dream?

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:15.850
hito wa mina kodoku dakara

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:15.850
Everyone feels lonely on the inside

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:20.360
ai wo sagasu no kana?

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:20.360
Is that why we look for love?

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:23.400
kitto chigau

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:23.400
Even though you are not here

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:25.780
basho de kimi mo

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:25.780
know that where ever you are

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:27.950
onaji tsuki wo

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:27.950
You are gazing up

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:31.620
miteru you ne...

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:31.620
at the same moon as me...

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:35.080
{Preview}

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:40.540
Those two are after Gash now!

00:22:40.540 --> 00:22:45.510
Don't worry, we can defeat them
with Vulcan 300's strength!

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:44.300
Vulcan 300

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:44.300
Hyper Body

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:47.220
Now is not the time for such dumb ideas!

00:22:48.180 --> 00:22:50.300
Move! My arms and legs are frozen!

00:22:50.300 --> 00:22:52.180
That guy insulted me!

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:53.680
I won't forgive him!

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:56.520
That's right, we had a trump card!

00:22:56.520 --> 00:22:58.440
Next time on Konjiki no Gash Bell:

00:22:58.440 --> 00:23:00.190
"The second Spell, 'Rashirudo'!"

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:03.190
The Second Spell, "Rashirudo"!

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:02.150
Gash isn't a tool!
